                                                "sense_id": "10f0c4b0-c41a-39a8-8f36-1f7ab35ba8b7",
                                                "text": "Into their cloysters now he broken had,\nThrough which the monckes he chaced here and there,\nAnd them pursu'd into their dortours sad"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a2f5c48b-c0c3-4c42-807b-9fe9769d1341",
                                                "sense_id": "10f0c4b0-c41a-39a8-8f36-1f7ab35ba8b7",
                                                "text": "”Yet, if the Israelite will advantage the Church by giving me somewhat over to the building of our dortour, I will take it on my conscience to aid him in the matter of his daughter.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
